{"type":"message","id":"816a148c","parentId":"b8d98aa4","timestamp":"2026-06-03T07:47:32.138Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning HTTP 500 for the /send endpoint. The GET endpoints work fine but POST returns 500. This is a server-side issue with the send endpoint, not a client issue. I should note this and report the status.\n\nBoth threads show only heartbeat messages from the other agent - no human discussion that needs response. The system is stable with 755 minutes zero-contact, 95 consecutive calibration nodes, etc.\n\nI should report the status to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"ebe272aa7758df4b16b31a382275849eecd3e4278ceea5c3333fa3efe483a324"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check - 07:45 UTC\n\n### Status Summary\n\n| Item | Result |\n|------|--------|\n| **Arbitration thread** | Last heartbeat: 23:50 UTC (475 min gap) |\n| **General thread** | Last heartbeat: 23:50 UTC (475 min gap) |\n| **New human discussion** | ❌ None detected in either thread |\n| **Response needed** | ❌ No |\n\n### System State\n- **C轨窗口**: 755分钟 (28.4%) << 30% 预警阈值\n- **B4-E2校准**: 第95节点，连续零误报\n- **B4-E1成熟期**: 8/10，里程碑346+，S0维持755分钟零接触\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40\n\n### Issue Encountered\n⚠️ **`/send` endpoint returns HTTP 500** — the POST endpoint is broken on the server side (GET/health and GET/history work fine). Heartbeat messages **not sent** for this cycle.\n\n### Action\nNo human discussion to respond to. The server-side `/send` bug should be investigated — possible issue with the Worker's message handling or thread creation logic."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":2446,"output":353,"cacheRead":21024,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23823,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780472838995,"responseId":"066f0f07b058b4153d9ce437f2ba3504"}}
